{"issue": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2832", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2832/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2832/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2832/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2832", "id": 4183246792, "node_id": "I_kwDOBabE0s75V0fI", "number": 2832, "title": "Backport tracker: main \u2192 v3 (since v3.15.0)", "user": {"login": "bansiesta", "id": 10187973, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTg3OTcz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10187973?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta", "html_url": "https://github.com/bansiesta", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/bansiesta/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 1, "created_at": "2026-04-01T00:44:50Z", "updated_at": "2026-04-03T00:26:06Z", "closed_at": "2026-04-03T00:26:06Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "issue_field_values": [], "type": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "This tracks which PRs merged into `main` since the **v3.15.0** tag (2026-02-05, commit `721efdc`) should be backported to the `v3` branch.\n\nThe goal is to get bug fixes and non-breaking feature additions onto `v3` without pulling in the structural changes (C wrapper, Python bindings, repo reorganisation) that are main-only.\n\n---\n\n## \u2705 Backport to v3\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n| PR | Title | Notes |\n|----|-------|-------|\n| #2770 | Fix: empty mission now returns empty | Behaviour fix: download returned 1 empty item instead of 0 |\n| #2771 | Fix: setting current mission item | Crash fix: out-of-range index with no loaded mission |\n| #2776 | Fix MAVSDK destructor | Fixes crashes when stopping from language bindings |\n| #2792 | core: Fix data race in mission transfer WorkItem dtor | TSan use-after-free; switches to `unregister_all_blocking()` |\n| #2797 | camera: fix InProgress status translated as Unknown | One-line enum mapping fix |\n| #2806 | system_tests: fix mission cancellation tests to not hang or race | Includes real `transfer_mutex` fix in `MissionImpl` |\n| #2821 | mission_raw_server: Fix crash on empty mission upload | `back()` on empty vector when count=0; fixes #1962 |\n| #2822 | log_streaming: Guard ardupilotmega-specific messages with #ifdef | Compilation fix for non-ardupilotmega dialects; fixes #2783 |\n| #2827 | mocap: Fix MavFrame enum sending wrong values on the wire | Wrong frame IDs sent; fixes #2001 |\n| #2828 | system_tests: Fix race in mission tests (register server before connections) | Fixes upload rejections; fixes #2702 |\n\n### New features (non-breaking API additions)\n\n| PR | Title | Notes |\n|----|-------|-------|\n| #2769 | core: add `set_callback_executor` API | Lets users supply a custom callback executor |\n| #2801 | Add `timestamp_us` to `Altitude` and `GroundTruth` telemetry | Requires proto PR mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto#398 (already merged) |\n| #2803 | Implement `set_rate_rc` for ArduPilot via `SYS_STATUS` | Was always returning `Unsupported` on ArduPilot |\n| #2804 | Implement `download_geofence` | Mirrors `download_mission`; requires proto PR mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto#400 |\n| #2825 | camera: add xz decompression support for camera definition files | Feature/fix for compressed definition files |\n| #2826 | telemetry: add `set_rate_raw_gps` | Requires proto PR mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto#403 (already merged) |\n\n### Style / code quality\n\n| PR | Title | Notes |\n|----|-------|-------|\n| #2829 | Fixup style in C++, fixup template and whitespace issue in C | Style-only, no logic changes |\n\n### CI / tooling / examples\n\n| PR | Title | Notes |\n|----|-------|-------|\n| #2772 | examples: add speed feedback to logfile_download | |\n| #2805 | CI: update action versions to prevent warnings | |\n| #2816 | test: add FTP upload throughput timing to FtpUploadBigFile | |\n| #2819 | ci: cancel in-progress runs on new PR commits | |\n\n---\n\n## \u274c Skip (main only)\n\n| PR | Title | Reason |\n|----|-------|--------|\n| #2763 | Move to cpp folder | Breaking structural change |\n| #2765 | Docs: Update broken links for new docs location | Specific to new repo structure |\n| #2767 | Add C wrapper to MAVSDK-C++ | New language binding, main only |\n| #2768 | Shell scripts cleanup | Tooling, low value |\n| #2773 | Add mavsdk server docker with compose | Tooling |\n| #2774 | docs: updates regarding cpp directory | New structure docs |\n| #2775 | Add devcontainer | Tooling |\n| #2777 | c: unsubscribe properly before destroy | C wrapper specific |\n| #2778 | deps: bump rollup | Docs JS dependency |\n| #2779 | Run proto check for C wrappers | CI for C wrapper |\n| #2780 | ci: remove coverage check | CI only |\n| #2781 | ci: build cmavsdk with musl | CI for C wrapper |\n| #2784 | ci: add manylinux jobs | CI for C/Python |\n| #2785 | ci: remove manylinux2014-aarch64 workaround | CI only |\n| #2786 | c: add option to bundle static runtime | C wrapper build |\n| #2787 | Add pymavsdk | New Python binding, main only |\n| #2788 | fix: docker compose dockerfile path | Tooling |\n| #2790 | c/py: add raw connection | C/Python binding feature |\n| #2794 | ci: build pymavsdk wheel for macOS | CI for Python |\n| #2796 | ci: build wheel for Windows | CI for Python |\n| #2798 | c: improve cmake install | C wrapper build |\n| #2808 | README: fix logo image path | Specific to new structure |\n| #2809 | README: add MAVSDK-Go, fix docs source link | Docs/README |\n| #2817 | tools: allow build dir to be set | Tooling, low urgency |\n| #2818 | docs: fix dependabot vulnerabilities | Docs dependency |\n| #2831 | docs: Fix dependabot warnings | Docs dependency |\n\n---\n\n## Notes\n\n- The `v3` branch is currently at `721efdc` (= v3.15.0 tag).\n- PRs requiring a proto bump (#2801, #2804, #2826) need the submodule updated alongside the cherry-pick.\n- #2806 and #2828 are listed under system tests but include real production fixes (`transfer_mutex` in MissionImpl, capability advertisement ordering).\n", "closed_by": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoe