 | mission_raw_server: fix crash on empty mission upload |\n| #2822 | log_streaming: guard ardupilotmega-specific messages with `#ifdef` |\n| #2825 | camera: add xz decompression support for camera definition files |\n| #2826 | telemetry: add `set_rate_raw_gps` |\n| #2827 | mocap: fix MavFrame enum sending wrong values on the wire |\n| #2828 | system_tests: fix race in mission tests by registering server before connections |\n\n**Notes:**\n- `cpp/` path prefix stripped from all patches (v3 uses original directory structure)\n- `c/` and `py/` bindings changes excluded (not present in v3)\n- Proto submodule updated from `ryanf55/MAVSDK-Proto` to `mavlink/MAVSDK-Proto` at `1da8975` (includes DownloadGeofence, SetRateRawGps, timestamp_us)\n- PR #2829 (style fixup) skipped \u2014 only affected C wrapper and auto-generated docs\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2833/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2833/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": null}}, "event": "cross-referenced"}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/4181146396", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2832#issuecomment-4181146396", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2832", "id": 4181146396, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s75Nzsc", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_u